  "statement": "I support the proposal to merge TRU-03 and RES-03 for a unified audit trail, as this maintains accountability while minimizing redundancy. However, it is essential that the integration of TRU-02 with double-entry principles (SAF-02) allows for comprehensive oversight to prevent discrepancies, ensuring safety and reliability. I also propose that we incorporate safety measures into discrepancy detection mechanisms in RES-04, aligning our goals for safety with ethical accountability.",
